        <mxCell id="3UykYJWGWMT3ES3CmtCb-44" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="Restrictions:&lt;div&gt;- A Book has at most one active Loan at a time.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- A Member has at most 3 active Loans.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- A Member with any overdue Loan cannot take new Loans.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- A Book can be lent only if it is not retired.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Only an active Loan can be returned (active → returned, no way back).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- A Loan of a retired Book can still be returned.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- dueDate = borrowedAt + 14 days.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Several Books (copies) may share the same isbn.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="390" x="420" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
